X: 1
T: Creator of the Stars of Night
C: Words: anonymous, 7th Century.  Translated by John Mason Neale, 1852.
C: Music: 'Conditor Alme Siderum' Proper Sarum Melody.
C: Setting: "The English Hymnal", 1906.
C: copyright: public domain.  This score is a part of the Open Hymnal Project, 2026 Revision.
S: Music and Lyrics source: "The English Hymnal", 1906 Hymn 1
